    "body": "I think that seems reasonable.\n\nAs far as I can tell, there's no issue with navigating iframes since you can only hold a reference to the `WindowProxy` which doesn't change on navigation. If the script is allowed to call `open()` after a navigation, it should work. ([demo](https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/14235))\n\nThe `document.open()` method https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-document-open-window checks if the document is fully active, so should be fine already.",
